  "description": "NeuraMorphix HackForge 2026 About NeuraMorphix HackForge 2026 is a 2-Day Online Hackathon organized by Team NeuraMorphix, a student-led AI initiative focused on building innovative solutions for real-world problems. Hackathon : 19–20 September 2026 Mode : 100% Online Theme : Forge the Future — AI for Every Real Problem Got an idea that can change the world? This is your stage. IDEATE. BUILD. DISRUPT. Hackathon Timeline : • Registration Deadline: 15 September 2026 | 11:59 PM IST • Hackathon: 19–20 September 2026 • Problem Statement Release: 19 September 2026 | During Opening Ceremony • Idea Submission Deadline: 19 September 2026 | 8:00 PM IST • Prototype Presentation: 20 September 2026 | 8:00 AM onwards • Final Round: 20 September 2026 | 2:30 PM onwards • Results: 20 September 2026 Mode: 100% Online Problem Statements : Problem statements will be released LIVE during the Opening Ceremony on 19 September 2026. Each team must select one problem statement and build their solution around it. Solutions should demonstrate: • Originality ️• Feasibility • Real-World Relevance ️Problem statements will NOT be shared separately. Attendance at the Opening Ceremony is strongly recommended. Eligibility : Open to: • Class 10, 11 & 12 students • 1st & 2nd-year undergraduate students • Students from any school/college/university meeting the above eligibility • Solo participants or teams of up to 4 members Inter-school/inter-college teams allowed Inter-specialization teams allowed Any programming language, tech stack, or framework may be used Team Formation : • Team Size: 1–4 members • Inter-college teams are allowed • Inter-specialization teams are allowed • Each participant can be part of only one team Hackathon Format Day 1 — 19 September 9:00 AM — Inauguration & Problem Statement Release 10:00 AM onwards — Ideation & Development 8:00 PM — Idea Submission Deadline 8:00 PM onwards — PPT & Prototype Presentation Round Day 2 — 20 September 8:00 AM – 1:00 PM — Shortlisted Prototype Pre",
